{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Rees 代数"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Rees代数"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>含幺交换环 $A$ 的理想 $I$ 的 Rees 代数为\n$$\r\nA[It] := \\bigoplus_{n\\geq 0} I^n t^n \\subset A[t].\r\n$$</p>\n<p>扩展 Rees 代数为\n$$\r\nA[t^{-1},It] := \\bigoplus_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}} I^n t^{n} \\subset A[t,t^{-1}].\r\n$$\n其中约定当 $n \\leq 0$ 时 $I^n = A$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n"}}